00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.560
From the 14th century to the 16th century,

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:27.360
there was a movement to revive
classical arts in Florence.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.700
The word "renaissance" is the French
word for "revival" or "rebirth."

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.120
It signified the escape from the restraints of
medieval feudalism and the Church,

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.660
and a return to humanism.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.380
This period is divided up into the Early
Renaissance, the High Renaissance

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:47.880
and the Late Renaissance, which
includes the Mannerism period.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:53.010
Major painters of the Early Renaissance
include Masaccio and Botticelli.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.430
The High Renaissance was the
period when the great painters

00:06:55.430 --> 00:07:01.020
Leonardo da Vinci, Raphael and
Michaelangelo were active.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.480
Their major works include the Mona Lisa,
Madonna and Child, and David.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.980
The art preparation room, huh?
