At times like that, you should
stop looking for it.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.430
What? Really?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.520
Yeah!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.360
We can't find it.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.690
Yeah...

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.570
Of course.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.940
Can't you remember anything else?

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:33.410
Umm, this morning, Miya-chan
slipped on the stairs.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.450
I grabbed her shoulder strap and it ripped.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.490
What?!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.450
Thanks to that, I was saved.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.210
That was a close call.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:46.670
Then, Ms. Yoshinoya told us to come to
the art preparation room after school.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.000
Oh?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.550
Wh-What is it?

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.800
I see!

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.800
You've stepped into the forbidden room.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.640
Did you come out a different person?

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:00.850
Did you lose anything important?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.940
Huh? What?

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:05.150
I know! So, that's why your
sketchbook is missing!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.110
I don't think it is.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.150
If anything, I think I gained
something important!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:11.950
What? Really?

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.450
A shoulder strap.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.780
Is that all?

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:18.620
Actually, she reattached a
shirt button for me too.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.830
That's great.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:24.580
While she was doing that, she made
me wear a cape she made.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:28.460
At first, I thought it was weird,
but it was pretty comfortable.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.590
Oh? What was it like?

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:34.220
It was like the clothes a clown
would wear in a fairytale.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.430
What kind of clothes are those?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:41.350
I know. Did you by any chance take
your sketchbook to school?

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.440
I was panicked this morning.

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:48.360
I might have left it in class.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.320
I'm going to go check.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.650
Okay, I hope you find it.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:54.820
Yeah!

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:58.830
Oh?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.870
Ms. Yoshinoya!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:03.870
You seem different when you're wearing
your regular clothes at school.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.120
What's going on?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.580
Thank you very much for earlier.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.460
I'm looking for something.

