00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:16.970
Huh?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.050
Umm...

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.010
It's an orange sketchbook.

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.390
I didn't see it in the classroom.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:28.270
Perhaps it's mixed with the books
on your bookshelf at home.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.730
I checked my bookshelf.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.780
Did you check under your bed?

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.570
It wasn't there either.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.110
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.580
I was thinking of typical places
to hide porn magazines!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:44.040
I don't plan on digging those
out of your room!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.410
What?! I don't have any!

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.960
Ms. Yoshinoya, come over here.

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:54.010
Y-You've got the wrong idea!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.590
Why did you do that?!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.430
I was helping Yuno find something.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:04.220
Your inappropriate comments
had nothing to do with that.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.560
By the way, what are you looking for?

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.400
It's a sketchbook.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:15.570
I looked all over my room and I even
checked my friends' rooms.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:21.070
So, I thought that maybe I forgot it in class.

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.240
Oh?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.950
If those are the only places you've looked,
it's probably somewhere unexpected.

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.200
Unexpected
