00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.490
I can't find it! I can't find it! I can't find it!

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.950
I'm going to sleep!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.540
I won't look for it anymore today!

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:28.310
I'm glad you found it.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.850
Yeah, sorry for bothering you.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.350
But why was it under your bedding?

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:36.690
Yesterday, I fell asleep as
I was drawing in bed.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.230
I completely forgot.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:40.700
I see. What were you drawing?

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.410
Umm, actually, all of you.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.030
Miya-chan, and Sae and Hiro...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:46.990
Huh?

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.870
I want to see it!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.750
Huh? Well, umm...

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.670
There, there...

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.720
Goodnight!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.340
Goodnight.
Goodnight!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:01.970
Goodnight.

