00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.900
I think I'm going to take a bath.
What about you?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.770
I'm going to sleep already!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:17.980
That's early.

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:21.530
Well, goodnight, Miya-chan.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.200
Goodnight, Yunocchi.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.370
Today wore me out.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.870
But I'm glad I found it.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:37.210
Now that I think about it,
everyone's advice was spot on!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.760
When you can't find something,
it's often underneath something else.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.340
You might be able to remember where you left
it if you remember what you were doing.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.430
You should stop looking for it.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:50.270
It's probably somewhere unexpected.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.390
Amazing...

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.020
That's really amazing!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:57.310
