00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.070
Hula dance...

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.530
Hawaii...

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.110
Loco moco...

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.740
Moko moko...

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.620
Bedding?!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.370
That's stretching it too far.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.380
I discovered a lot of things today.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.550
I haven't forgot anything else, have I?

